Survey 1 for cycle 3 is written to `runs\Absolute_2026-09-28_02\sota\cycle-003\survey-1.json`.

Stage 2 runs once, on the single candidate `select_detection` returns. The other class-matched source indexes are dropped, and `PalletPoseStamped` has no field for them. The cost is the chamfer grid: 45,700 distance evaluations when the prior search runs (skipped only if the free cost is at or below about 0.006233 m). Each evaluation copies and sorts all 182 prototype points, and only the lowest 164 are summed. The depth scan, RANSAC, and the distance transform run once per chosen detection and are smaller than that grid.
